oset.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c8b261132174a7d4\" href=\"?note=c8b261132174a7d4\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-initial-segment.md\">58-df-zfc-initial-segment.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12CutCompletionCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12CutCompletionCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}cut\\text{-}completion\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12CutCompletionCarrier}_S(C,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(L,\\leq_L)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_L\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_L)\\land\nC=\\Bigl\\{A\\subseteq L:\nA\\neq\\emptyset\\land A\\neq L\\land\\mathrm{InitialSegment}_S(A,L,\\leq_L)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\leq_L\\land a\\neq b)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}cut\\text{-}completion\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12CutCompletionCarrier}_S(C,L,\\leq_L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(L,\\leq_L)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in L\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_L\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_L)\\land\nC=\\Bigl\\{A\\subseteq L:\nA\\neq\\emptyset\\land A\\neq L\\land\\mathrm{InitialSegment}_S(A,L,\\leq_L)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\leq_L\\land a\\neq b)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier consists of genuine Dedekind cuts relative to an explicit linear-order relation, used throughout by ordered-pair membership.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[